WEBVTT

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:36.280
<b>After getting drunk at the year-end party, Gintoki discovers 
that he passed the critical point with six people in one night!!</b>

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:41.080
<b>Zenzo suggests that Gintoki live with all of them at the same time. 
Can Gintoki take responsibility for his actions? Does he even want to?!</b>

00:01:41.080 --> 00:01:47.000
<b>People Can Only Live By Forgetting the Bad</b>

00:01:48.460 --> 00:01:50.370
What's with the look on your face?

00:01:50.370 --> 00:01:53.630
You can't handle taking responsibility 
for all six of them?

00:01:53.630 --> 00:01:55.880
What does he mean, all six of them?!

00:01:56.390 --> 00:01:59.180
Each of them is the equivalent 
of a thousand idiots.

00:01:59.180 --> 00:02:00.510
How do you expect me to handle that?

00:02:01.180 --> 00:02:05.680
You don't get to complain after having 
your way with all of them in one night.

00:02:06.020 --> 00:02:08.170
What does he mean, all of them?!

00:02:08.170 --> 00:02:10.690
Hey! You were just toying with me?!

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:13.070
The women are certainly fired up.

00:02:13.470 --> 00:02:14.960
They're damn tough.

00:02:14.960 --> 00:02:18.320
Once they've made a decision, 
they'll follow it through.

00:02:18.720 --> 00:02:22.220
Why not make all six of them happy?

00:02:22.220 --> 00:02:23.470
That's not possible!

00:02:23.880 --> 00:02:26.830
I should apologize before 
this gets any uglier.

00:02:26.830 --> 00:02:29.160
Then tell them everything.

00:02:29.160 --> 00:02:31.830
Unload the burden and set yourself free,

00:02:31.820 --> 00:02:34.310
and leave the women to taste hell.

00:02:37.340 --> 00:02:40.520
Oh? Fancy meeting you here.

00:02:40.520 --> 00:02:42.780
What are you doing here, Sarutobi-san?

00:02:42.780 --> 00:02:43.720
O-Over there!

00:02:44.100 --> 00:02:45.710
M-My worst fears have been realized!

00:02:45.710 --> 00:02:48.160
The women have bumped into one another!

00:02:48.160 --> 00:02:50.320
Oh? You want to know?

00:02:50.320 --> 00:02:54.050
I'm living happily with my 
darling in this apartment.

00:02:54.050 --> 00:02:55.860
Hey! Don't say another word!

00:02:56.110 --> 00:02:57.310
Congratulations.

00:02:57.310 --> 00:02:59.810
Is your darling a figment 
of your imagination? CG?

00:02:59.810 --> 00:03:01.360
How rude! He's not two dimensional!

00:03:01.520 --> 00:03:03.870
Oh, so those are 3D glasses.

00:03:04.380 --> 00:03:05.580
What a coincidence.

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:07.620
I'm also living with someone special now.

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:08.320
Huh?

00:03:08.320 --> 00:03:09.470
You must be joking!

00:03:09.470 --> 00:03:11.150
A crude girl like you is living with a man?!

00:03:11.150 --> 00:03:12.000
Who is it?

00:03:13.110 --> 00:03:14.700
That's a secret.

00:03:14.700 --> 00:03:16.590
He told me not to tell anyone.

00:03:16.590 --> 00:03:18.760
M-My darling also told me not to tell anyone!

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:20.000
He used his lips to seal mine!

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:21.220
Don't lie!

00:03:21.220 --> 00:03:22.130
Why are you competing with each other?!

00:03:22.570 --> 00:03:25.510
I see. So Tae-chan has 
found a special someone.

00:03:25.840 --> 00:03:26.980
Kyu-chan.

00:03:26.980 --> 00:03:29.500
That settles it then.

00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:33.900
I'll face reality and 
live happily as a woman.

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:35.900
With him.

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:38.220
Kyubei-san, don't tell me that 
you've also found someone?!

00:03:38.220 --> 00:03:39.460
R-Really, Kyu-chan?

00:03:39.460 --> 00:03:40.790
Wh-Who is he?

00:03:40.790 --> 00:03:41.970
I can't tell you...

00:03:41.970 --> 00:03:44.410
Hey! This is about to get really nasty!

00:03:44.770 --> 00:03:46.990
Stop playing coy and tell us who it is!

00:03:46.990 --> 00:03:48.600
It's probably some ugly pig!

00:03:48.600 --> 00:03:51.450
That's right. I need to say 
hello to your boyfriend!

00:03:51.450 --> 00:03:56.540
When the time comes, we'll 
visit you and Polygonzo.

00:03:56.540 --> 00:03:57.970
What's that supposed to mean?!

00:03:57.970 --> 00:03:59.330
Just tell us now!

00:03:59.330 --> 00:04:01.020
Enough of this foolishness.

00:04:01.420 --> 00:04:04.820
An outsider shouldn't pry into 
someone's private affairs.

00:04:04.820 --> 00:04:06.800
Leave her be.

00:04:07.030 --> 00:04:10.290
Well, well, you look so lovely in that apron.

00:04:10.290 --> 00:04:12.710
Don't worry. Nobody's interested in you.

00:04:12.710 --> 00:04:15.860
But if you want to know who my 
darling is, I might tell you!

00:04:15.860 --> 00:04:17.830
Have fun with Pixelmon.

00:04:17.830 --> 00:04:19.780
Stop lowering the quality!

00:04:20.290 --> 00:04:21.900
Enough already.

00:04:22.350 --> 00:04:25.330
Just so you know, my darling is super hot!

00:04:25.330 --> 00:04:27.500
I guarantee that he'll blow your 
boyfriends out of the water!

00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:28.990
Stop it! Not another word!

00:04:29.190 --> 00:04:31.490
Of course, since he's CG.

00:04:31.490 --> 00:04:35.120
My boyfriend looks kind of dumb, 
but he's a venture entrepreneur.

00:04:35.670 --> 00:04:38.090
We live in this worn down 
apartment right now,

00:04:38.090 --> 00:04:41.280
but eventually he'll help turn our 
dojo into a palace where we can live.

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:43.880
<b>Kodokan Dojo</b>

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:42.090
Venture entrepreneur?!

00:04:42.090 --> 00:04:43.880
I never promised anything!

00:04:44.080 --> 00:04:48.010
Tae-chan, a man needs more than 
money to protect his family.

00:04:48.440 --> 00:04:51.880
My boyfriend doesn't have much 
income, but he's a strong fighter.

00:04:51.880 --> 00:04:55.190
I believe that he's one of the 
Seven Warlords of the Sea.

00:04:55.190 --> 00:04:56.270
The hell I am!

00:04:56.270 --> 00:04:57.650
Why do they have to compete?!

00:04:57.920 --> 00:04:59.150
Foolishness.

00:04:59.150 --> 00:05:02.950
The only thing that matters is 
that you believe he's the best.

00:05:02.950 --> 00:05:06.330
Well, I don't particularly feel 
that my boyfriend is that special.

00:05:06.330 --> 00:05:09.350
But he was popular with 
the Yoshiwara courtesans.

00:05:09.350 --> 00:05:12.730
And he defeated the villain 
of Yoshiwara all by himself.

00:05:12.730 --> 00:05:14.660
So you're still going to join in?!

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:17.570
You're also bragging about your man, Tsu-ki!

00:05:17.570 --> 00:05:21.240
Well, my boyfriend would have no trouble 
defeating the villain of Yoshiwara.

00:05:21.240 --> 00:05:23.300
And my boyfriend is also one of 
the Seven Warlords of the Sea.

00:05:23.300 --> 00:05:24.630
Y-You too?

00:05:25.250 --> 00:05:28.060
What a coincidence! My darling is 
also one of the Seven Warlords!

00:05:28.060 --> 00:05:29.810
What a small world.

00:05:29.810 --> 00:05:32.810
Four of the Seven Warlords 
live in this apartment.

00:05:32.810 --> 00:05:35.480
Over half of the Warlords are me!

00:05:35.480 --> 00:05:38.600
Hmph, you girls are so blabby.

00:05:38.600 --> 00:05:42.970
