00:06:00.300 --> 00:06:02.320
But since tomorrow is the 7th,

00:06:02.320 --> 00:06:07.170
he mentioned that we might go out, 
since he's one of the Seven Warlords.

00:06:07.910 --> 00:06:09.180
I believe.

00:06:09.180 --> 00:06:11.550
Gran! You're joining in?!

00:06:11.550 --> 00:06:14.320
Oh, you're also going 
on a Seven Warlord date?

00:06:14.320 --> 00:06:15.400
So am I!

00:06:15.400 --> 00:06:18.120
Oh, I believe my darling 
mentioned something about that!

00:06:18.120 --> 00:06:19.760
Hey, enough of this.

00:06:19.760 --> 00:06:22.010
I was the first one to bring 
up the Seven Warlords.

00:06:22.010 --> 00:06:23.170
R-Really?

00:06:23.170 --> 00:06:25.260
So we'll all be going on dates tomorrow?

00:06:25.260 --> 00:06:26.820
Maybe we'll run into each other somewhere.

00:06:26.820 --> 00:06:28.520
