00:06:28.520 --> 00:06:29.800
The hell is a Seven Warlord date?!

00:06:29.800 --> 00:06:30.980
There's only one warlord here!

00:06:30.980 --> 00:06:32.890
There's only Whitehair Gintoki!

00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:39.530
It all happened so suddenly.

00:06:39.530 --> 00:06:42.720
So we haven't been on a real date yet.

00:06:42.720 --> 00:06:45.050
I'm busy tomorrow...

00:06:45.050 --> 00:06:46.290
The neighbor said her boyfriend

00:06:46.290 --> 00:06:47.930
