00:07:00.290 --> 00:07:02.040
Fine, how about the 8th?

00:07:02.040 --> 00:07:04.450
One day shouldn't make 
that much of a difference.

00:07:04.450 --> 00:07:05.980
I want to go on the 7th.

00:07:05.980 --> 00:07:08.350
Why does it have to be on the 7th?

00:07:08.350 --> 00:07:11.610
Well, I was told that I 
don't have long to live.

00:07:11.610 --> 00:07:12.430
By the 8th, I'll be...

00:07:12.430 --> 00:07:13.740
Don't lie to me, you old hag!

00:07:13.740 --> 00:07:15.990
Anyway, I want to go on the 7th.

00:07:15.990 --> 00:07:17.470
Can you tell me why?

00:07:17.470 --> 00:07:20.050
Oh, sorry. My hand slipped.

00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:22.050
Why won't the 8th work?

00:07:22.050 --> 00:07:23.710
Oh, my hand slipped.

00:07:36.510 --> 00:07:38.520
<b>Greater Edo Planetarium</b>

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:40.790
Ten minutes until you're 
supposed to meet them.

00:07:40.790 --> 00:07:41.770
Are you ready?

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:45.880
Yeah, tell Shinpachi and Kagura 
to take care of themselves.

00:07:45.880 --> 00:07:47.900
Don't worry. You can make this work.

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:51.120
Unfortunately, I only have one body.

00:07:51.120 --> 00:07:53.410
I can't go on a date with 
five people at the same time.

00:07:53.620 --> 00:07:56.040
Hey, who do you think I am?

00:07:56.040 --> 00:07:58.410
I once led the Oniwabanshu.

00:07:58.610 --> 00:08:01.540
Are you going to teach 
me the Clone Technique?

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:05.070
Five is pretty difficult, 
so we'll start with two.

00:08:05.070 --> 00:08:06.010
Wait, are you serious?

00:08:06.010 --> 00:08:06.580
