Hey, what's that silhouette?

00:12:48.270 --> 00:12:49.160
It's flying?

00:12:49.980 --> 00:12:50.790
What's that?

00:12:51.460 --> 00:12:52.210
Huh?

00:12:52.210 --> 00:12:53.440
Isn't that Gin-san?

00:12:53.440 --> 00:12:54.510
Hey, it disappeared.

00:12:54.510 --> 00:12:55.620
Where did it go?

00:12:55.620 --> 00:12:57.430
Maybe it's a constellation?

00:12:57.430 --> 00:12:59.630
That's a toilet with a shower.

00:12:59.630 --> 00:13:01.290
Oh, a toilet.

00:13:01.290 --> 00:13:02.460
Didn't know there was a toilet constellation.

00:13:03.970 --> 00:13:05.670
Unit 03! Pull yourself together!

00:13:05.670 --> 00:13:06.820
Hey, Unit 03!

00:13:06.820 --> 00:13:09.450
Hold on, I'll give you mouth-to-nozzle!

00:13:09.450 --> 00:13:11.220
Come back to us, Unit 03!

00:13:11.220 --> 00:13:14.230
Princess! Master Gintoki has vanished!

00:13:14.450 --> 00:13:16.220
Oh, no. I kicked him too hard.

00:13:16.220 --> 00:13:17.280
Hey, Gintoki!

00:13:17.280 --> 00:13:18.060
Are you okay?!

00:13:18.400 --> 00:13:21.440
Guess I'll ditch the sleeping 
old hag and go for a recovery.

00:13:21.690 --> 00:13:25.450
Why are the people in the 
center making so much noise?

00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:27.320
I should go warn them.

00:13:27.450 --> 00:13:29.950
Sh-Shit! They're going 
to bump into each other!

00:13:30.350 --> 00:13:33.540
I believe that this string controls Unit 02!

00:13:37.840 --> 00:13:39.080
You don't want me to go?

00:13:39.520 --> 00:13:42.340
Are you lonely without me, Darling?

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:44.930
Don't worry! I won't go anywhere!

00:13:44.930 --> 00:13:46.500
I'll always be here for you!

00:13:46.500 --> 00:13:47.720
I-I'm saved...

00:13:47.980 --> 00:13:49.020
I don't understand what happened,

00:13:49.020 --> 00:13:51.740
but apparently I made the doll grab her hand.

00:13:51.740 --> 00:13:53.600
Um, Gin-san?

00:13:55.130 --> 00:13:57.480
That's my juice...

00:13:57.960 --> 00:13:58.670
Huh?

00:13:58.670 --> 00:14:01.670
I also made Unit 01 grab something?

00:14:01.670 --> 00:14:02.730
Er, don't tell me...

00:14:03.080 --> 00:14:05.990
H-Hey, what do you think you're 
doing in this public place?

00:14:06.640 --> 00:14:09.140
Hey! Unit 04 is grabbing something!

00:14:09.140 --> 00:14:10.620
What is he grabbing?!

00:14:11.260 --> 00:14:13.370
He was grabbing someone's thing!

00:14:13.630 --> 00:14:15.160
Wait, Unit 04!

00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:16.540
That's the wrong side!

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:18.370
Don't pull that out!

00:14:18.630 --> 00:14:19.610
I've figured it out!

00:14:19.610 --> 00:14:21.810
Their movements are linked!

00:14:21.810 --> 00:14:24.630
These clones are so hard to use!

00:14:25.750 --> 00:14:28.830
Honestly, young people 
these days are hopeless.

00:14:28.830 --> 00:14:30.720
Fortunately, the darkness 
is giving me cover,

00:14:31.200 --> 00:14:33.700
but Tsukuyo is going to 
notice sooner or later!

00:14:33.700 --> 00:14:35.570
Here you go, Darling. Ah!

00:14:36.520 --> 00:14:38.560
Eat this. Ah!

00:14:38.560 --> 00:14:40.610
I don't have time to deal with you!

00:14:40.610 --> 00:14:42.110
The guy next to Unit 04 is...

00:14:42.110 --> 00:14:42.820
Damn it!

00:14:42.820 --> 00:14:44.230
How do I open my mouth?!

00:14:44.230 --> 00:14:46.070
Which string is it?! This one?!

00:14:46.070 --> 00:14:48.220
What brought that on?

00:14:48.670 --> 00:14:51.450
Are you nervous?

00:14:52.060 --> 00:14:53.550
It's so strange.

00:14:53.550 --> 00:14:56.480
We didn't used to have any issues 
when we were alone together.

00:14:56.480 --> 00:14:58.980
Now I get so nervous whenever I'm with you.

00:15:00.220 --> 00:15:01.710
Gin-san, are you also...

00:15:03.690 --> 00:15:04.460
Gin-san?

00:15:04.860 --> 00:15:06.450
W-Wait a second!

00:15:06.450 --> 00:15:08.950
W-We can't do that here!

00:15:08.950 --> 00:15:10.170
G-Gin-san!

00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:12.550
At the worst possible time!

00:15:13.720 --> 00:15:15.430
I-It's okay!

00:15:15.430 --> 00:15:17.010
It might look like a kiss!

00:15:17.010 --> 00:15:19.310
A very wild kind of kiss!

00:15:19.800 --> 00:15:21.810
The hell did you open your mouth for?!

00:15:22.050 --> 00:15:23.060
Here you are.

00:15:23.370 --> 00:15:26.720
Next, you should feed me.

00:15:26.720 --> 00:15:27.370
Ah!

00:15:27.370 --> 00:15:28.890
Shut the hell up!

00:15:28.890 --> 00:15:30.610
Don't make any more trouble for me!

00:15:30.860 --> 00:15:32.240
Hurry, Darling!

00:15:32.480 --> 00:15:33.870
Damn, I have to feed her?

00:15:33.870 --> 00:15:34.950
How?

00:15:36.510 --> 00:15:38.120
What did you feed him?!

00:15:38.120 --> 00:15:40.120
Don't get too friendly now!

00:15:40.630 --> 00:15:43.650
That one's about to be eaten alive.

00:15:43.650 --> 00:15:46.000
That girl is more like 
Unit 01 than my Unit 01!

00:15:46.440 --> 00:15:49.460
Damn, that means Unit 03 and Unit 
01 will both be out of action.

00:15:49.460 --> 00:15:51.630
If I lose any more dolls, I 
won't be able to cover my ass!

00:15:51.880 --> 00:15:53.090
Go back, Unit 04!

00:15:53.090 --> 00:15:54.260
Go back to your seat!

00:15:54.670 --> 00:15:56.580
Could you stop this?

00:15:56.580 --> 00:15:59.640
Can't you do that somewhere else?

00:15:59.890 --> 00:16:01.050
Well, Gintoki?

00:16:01.050 --> 00:16:03.400
Damn, she's going to find out!
Go back to your seat!

00:16:04.660 --> 00:16:06.860
Whew, barely made it...

00:16:06.860 --> 00:16:09.320
Ah! Someone help!

00:16:09.840 --> 00:16:11.110
What?! What happened?!

00:16:11.680 --> 00:16:13.910
My darling jumped into the vent!

00:16:14.130 --> 00:16:15.140
What?!

00:16:15.140 --> 00:16:17.830
Unit 02 also took a dive?!

00:16:17.830 --> 00:16:20.880
Oh, no! He's leaking gas from his ass!

00:16:20.880 --> 00:16:22.050
Hold on, Darling!

00:16:22.050 --> 00:16:23.840
I'll give you mouth-to-crotch!

00:16:23.840 --> 00:16:25.580
Unit 02 is down!

00:16:25.850 --> 00:16:27.590
Only Unit 04 is left!

00:16:27.900 --> 00:16:30.840
Now it's your turn to take 
that business somewhere else.

00:16:31.120 --> 00:16:32.720
Like Yoshiwara?

00:16:35.720 --> 00:16:37.370
Hey, what's that?

00:16:37.370 --> 00:16:38.720
What constellation is that?

00:16:39.060 --> 00:16:41.220
Th-They've been wiped out!

00:16:41.220 --> 00:16:44.660
There was no chance that they 
could handle those women!

00:16:44.660 --> 00:16:47.860
I'm going to end up like these dolls!

00:16:47.860 --> 00:16:48.590
Run!

00:16:48.590 --> 00:16:50.860
Run somewhere far away from 
this place and everyone here!

00:16:51.170 --> 00:16:52.860
That's the only way I can survive!

00:16:59.740 --> 00:17:03.090
Huh? Where are you going, Gintoki?

00:17:15.550 --> 00:17:17.570
Hey, I've been looking for you.

00:17:17.910 --> 00:17:19.910
That was a long dump.

00:17:19.910 --> 00:17:22.890
Yeah, I ran out of Preparation H.

00:17:24.890 --> 00:17:26.650
Is it all over?

00:17:28.400 --> 00:17:32.400
I see. Well, you should be 
glad you're still alive.

00:17:34.150 --> 00:17:35.300
Drink.

00:17:35.300 --> 00:17:37.160
Drink and forget all the bad stuff.

00:17:37.920 --> 00:17:40.530
I won't be able to forget this.

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:44.940
It must have been really bad.

00:17:44.960 --> 00:17:47.920
They were going to tear my 
six-timing balls into six balls

00:17:48.380 --> 00:17:51.300
and scatter them around the world 
so I would have to look for them.

00:17:51.300 --> 00:17:53.300
So first, they strung me up here.

00:17:53.680 --> 00:17:56.210
Then they went back for tools.

00:17:56.210 --> 00:17:58.810
But they haven't come back.

00:18:00.220 --> 00:18:03.930
Well, I'm guessing that they don't 
want to see your face again.

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:07.310
Still, I can't believe you 
survived for two weeks out here.

00:18:08.010 --> 00:18:09.810
On the morning of the third day,

00:18:09.810 --> 00:18:13.500
there was an unidentified 
substance hidden near me.

00:18:13.850 --> 00:18:15.990
On the fourth day, there was a hot pot.

00:18:15.990 --> 00:18:17.650
On the fifth day, it was curry.

00:18:17.650 --> 00:18:19.780
On the sixth and seventh days,

00:18:19.780 --> 00:18:21.650
there were familiar items lying around.

00:18:21.650 --> 00:18:24.200
I could drink an ocean and 
not forget that taste.

00:18:26.100 --> 00:18:28.400
I can't let myself forget.

00:18:30.360 --> 00:18:33.980
I was so worried about myself,

00:18:33.980 --> 00:18:36.840
that I never thought about them.

00:18:37.400 --> 00:18:40.720
But they still show kindness 
to the man who tricked them.

00:18:41.360 --> 00:18:44.470
What can I do for them?

00:18:44.470 --> 00:18:46.140
There's nothing left.

00:18:46.140 --> 00:18:48.440
You quit drinking, right?

00:18:48.440 --> 00:18:51.610
If that's what it takes, I'll 
never drink another drop.

00:18:52.320 --> 00:18:54.110
But that won't be enough...

00:18:54.110 --> 00:18:55.900
It will.

00:18:56.340 --> 00:18:57.820
Look at the bowl.

00:19:00.110 --> 00:19:03.490
<b>You've been punked!!</b>

00:19:05.050 --> 00:19:08.420
You just promised to quit drinking, right?

00:19:09.760 --> 00:19:13.250
You just promised to quit drinking, right?

00:19:15.350 --> 00:19:17.150
Stop! You're killing me!

00:19:17.150 --> 00:19:18.530
Turn off the TV! No more!

00:19:18.530 --> 00:19:19.800
That face is priceless!

00:19:19.800 --> 00:19:23.260
Man, I can't believe you tricked him 
into promising to quit drinking!

00:19:23.260 --> 00:19:26.810
But we may have gone too far.

00:19:26.820 --> 00:19:29.240
It's good that he quit drinking,

00:19:29.240 --> 00:19:32.520
but he actually thought 
that we slept together?

00:19:32.780 --> 00:19:34.890
He wasn't entirely innocent.

00:19:34.890 --> 00:19:36.890
Did you forget what 
happened during the party?

00:19:36.890 --> 00:19:41.410
He kept pestering us to drink more,

00:19:41.410 --> 00:19:46.540
and we had to pay for the repairs 
when he wrecked the bar.

00:19:46.780 --> 00:19:50.680
Yes, there is good drink and bad drink.

00:19:50.680 --> 00:19:52.400
He would be a bad drinker.

00:19:52.400 --> 00:19:54.460
You're in no position to talk!

00:19:54.460 --> 00:19:56.500
And you helped him wreck the bar!

00:19:57.420 --> 00:20:01.270
Well, normally, I would 
refuse to trick Gin-san,

00:20:01.270 --> 00:20:03.930
but since I got to live 
with him, I'm okay with it.

00:20:03.930 --> 00:20:25.450
<b>Sugar Content</b>

00:20:04.340 --> 00:20:06.050
Since I helped, make me a copy

00:20:06.050 --> 00:20:09.320
of the part where Gin-san 
and I are living together.

00:20:09.320 --> 00:20:10.740
Then make me a copy of the part

00:20:10.740 --> 00:20:12.620
where the lady is wearing 
nothing but an apron.

00:20:12.620 --> 00:20:14.370
That never happened.

00:20:14.370 --> 00:20:15.500
I can't do that.

00:20:15.500 --> 00:20:18.350
We have to hold onto this 
tape and show it to him

00:20:18.350 --> 00:20:20.670
whenever he feels like drinking.

00:20:20.670 --> 00:20:21.900
Hey, Gran.

00:20:21.900 --> 00:20:23.220
I'm the one who taped the whole thing.

00:20:23.220 --> 00:20:24.550
You should give me something for my trouble.

00:20:24.550 --> 00:20:25.750
Right.

00:20:25.750 --> 00:20:27.950
Let me see that look on his face again.

00:20:27.950 --> 00:20:35.460
<b>Odd Jobs Gin-chan
Snack Otose</b>

00:20:28.490 --> 00:20:30.430
What? Haven't you had enough?

00:20:30.430 --> 00:20:31.970
How many times have we watched this?

00:20:31.970 --> 00:20:33.230
I'm getting tired of...

00:20:41.250 --> 00:20:42.550
Yo, Gin-san.

00:20:42.550 --> 00:20:44.530
Want a drink?

00:20:46.190 --> 00:20:49.290
Odd Jobs, we have a new cutie.

00:20:49.290 --> 00:20:50.740
Stop by for a drink.

00:20:52.650 --> 00:20:54.260
What's wrong, big guy?

00:20:54.260 --> 00:20:55.980
Did you quit drinking?

00:20:56.890 --> 00:20:58.900
There must be a storm coming!

00:21:00.750 --> 00:21:02.150
Hey, there.

00:21:02.610 --> 00:21:05.240
How about a drink to help you 
forget all the bad stuff?

00:21:05.720 --> 00:21:07.990
I have nothing I want to forget.

00:21:08.680 --> 00:21:12.980
I won't forget your faces 
until I've gotten my revenge.

00:21:15.450 --> 00:21:17.500
Why are you the only one here?

00:21:19.500 --> 00:21:21.760
Because I want to forget.

00:21:22.390 --> 00:21:27.000
You're the ones who bent me over 
and forced me to quit drinking.

00:21:27.000 --> 00:21:28.390
Gin-san.

00:21:28.880 --> 00:21:30.470
I never did that.

00:21:32.640 --> 00:21:33.770
You're the one

00:21:35.960 --> 00:21:37.520
who bent me over.

00:21:53.420 --> 00:21:54.810
Pops!

00:21:54.810 --> 00:21:59.130
Give me the strongest liquor you got!

00:23:30.050 --> 00:23:30.800
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:23:30.800 --> 00:23:31.430
<b>We Are All Male Escorts, In Capital Letters</b>

00:23:30.800 --> 00:23:32.500
Next time:

00:23:31.430 --> 00:23:33.050
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:23:32.500 --> 00:23:33.410
Yay!

00:23:33.050 --> 00:23:33.720
<b>We Are All Male Escorts, In Capital Letters</b>

00:23:33.410 --> 00:23:35.100
In capital letters, okay?

00:23:33.720 --> 00:23:35.560
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:23:35.320 --> 00:23:36.090
Yes!

00:23:35.560 --> 00:23:36.520
<b>We Are All Male Escorts, In Capital Letters</b>

00:23:36.090 --> 00:23:38.310
Attention, all humans!

00:23:36.520 --> 00:23:39.310
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:23:38.570 --> 00:23:39.940
Thank you very much!

00:23:39.600 --> 00:23:39.940
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:23:39.940 --> 00:23:40.810
Male escorts!

00:23:40.190 --> 00:23:40.480
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:23:40.810 --> 00:23:41.350
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:23:40.810 --> 00:23:44.370
Just do it!

00:23:41.350 --> 00:23:45.020
<b>We Are All Male Escorts, In Capital Letters</b>

00:23:45.020 --> 00:23:50.860
<b>In order to save Kyoshiro, the Odd Jobs 
members become male escorts again!!</b>

00:23:50.860 --> 00:23:55.030
<b>So the Gintama anime will be back 
again next year. Just do it!! (Echo)</b>
